        <div class="col-span-2 row-span-2 relative overflow-hidden">
          <img alt="Bali Rice Terrace" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC71cEAfpBoCJXP5zOiue0hOpcd0vNxE05Wae2se0oYpe8rgoef55dOqgg2yMlikn1XSdnfnk0PG1TagJSqy6Jhq0vtY6ANM61TSiaE3OUuxLkQt3KAUuPufLQKkIeramzfz_o_WvtRz2NP7B701NEfUx56OWpg4DL-cG-2PyYujy5TYYHzErh4zhnxUb5jNAkb-1jZMWUnsTfwd8N2w6Azt3iN-F6GUvb68rmKGUUTEOVpn1nm54YfzcxzPgb8om3ULhs_99MQ24n_"/>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2 row-span-1 relative overflow-hidden">
          <img alt="Templo Balinés" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBurljYO2uMFAVMzjOilF4Yl2RI_98QHnY502BcGcL8O4sv_2e89MJacMMpsvOjBydFQEH2gWgpj_Hl3zQnsHkA1Loh-dOx8NBA-D3v5MDsvY0RjCvXy6Ybfvvfdc0b4qFEnTAJ1-u0bmCSzngQO5mSi0nUbcfuLsPZqG0PVhQt-FwuS7XKaP5Lhp8DVsgmugbnPGiC4fVTIY1AEb_x-nOTf_vjfwe7dVTcRwTmTGBItIyPvGq_DRXahBOb4Pfx9OkvH59dvVou7mxz"/>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1 row-span-1 relative overflow-hidden">
          <img alt="Piscina de Lujo" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC9czsxgtX9VJjw5w5efg6Vnk9ZktptnIP_hn9U9cSTa1aNM4qjzoYdsyKxIqi4SKP1jO95ekAL7zEkrsCzyNvXjK33w10YWXL8OcrmHN9MpPzplc1XP4fbiIfEf8-IwNmDRZzM5_shzHxxovRO2zg24vq8K4ZwRHJntm0_mF6HJpeI2VsSqMwzTlvXneKjPLJSq-ZsAHINdrtZl6BhKeMNJKABTS2TeKXyAnIyfKUQ6SSSmBOk91sH1MgDbLssXVNRZ76ucD7bqFW2"/>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1 row-span-1 relative overflow-hidden">
          <img alt="Amanecer en Bali" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAn6I2Nfjh6i3J_ot_fIlauqRxyr_E3JSf2Cev_enQyx1INS7F7Vy_lILJZI6xf06JJw-DdqYgt_fx5GrS2AzMraAjrJ5-SUttyi9JVst507EsiRRl_SglDBVerh-8Z4xo7_5PE7RLPVwbrHEXzmiZwb_rr-kkvso4bQqb5m4U7GtOkN_slZFP3oNUP2AcgPtaQcIS1FuHfbltSb0PTaKswl4zyWkbS2MdwWe650BNHV-I4lRr_yr96dXzW_bJgbvkUG582Hp0LDbqK"/>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-6">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
          <div>
            <span class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm uppercase tracking-wider inline-block mb-2">Destino Trending</span>
            <h1 class="text-display-lg font-display-lg text-white">Bali, Indonesia</h1>
            <p class="text-base text-white/90 max-w-xl">La Isla de los Dioses ofrece variados paisajes de colinas y montañas, costas escarpadas y playas de arena blanca.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <button class="bg-white/20 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-white/30 transition-all">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">share</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Compartir</span>
            </button>
            <button class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-5 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 shadow-card hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" data-weight="fill">bookmark</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Guardar Destino</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OVERVIEW -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-text-primary">Descripción General</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Bali es más que un destino; es un estado de ánimo, una aspiración, un paraíso tropical. Ya sea que busques la tranquilidad espiritual de los arrozales de Ubud, el surf de alta energía de Canggu o los lujosos retiros en los acantilados de Uluwatu, este paraíso indonesio satisface todos los caprichos del viajero.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
          <span class="bg-surface text-text-secondary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm">Tropical</span>
          <span class="bg-surface text-text-secondary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm">Cultural</span>
          <span class="bg-surface text-text-secondary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm">Luxury</span>
          <span class="bg-surface text-text-secondary px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm">Adventure</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface p-5 rounded-lg shadow-card border border-border flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">thermostat</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold">28°C · Soleado</span>
        </div>
        <hr class="border-border"/>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-text-secondary">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">currency_exchange</span>
          <span class="text-sm">1 USD = 15,700 IDR</span>
        </div>
        <hr class="border-border"/>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-text-secondary">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">translate</span>
          <span class="text-sm">Indonesio, Balinés, Inglés</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AI RECOMMENDATIONS -->
    <h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-text-primary">Recomendaciones de IA</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container p-6 rounded-lg shadow-card flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">calendar_month</span>
            <span class="font-headline-lg">Mejor Época para Visitar</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-base opacity-90">El análisis de IA sugiere viajar entre <strong>abril y octubre</strong> para la temporada seca. Las mejores condiciones para surfear ocurren entre mayo y septiembre.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <span class="block text-sm opacity-80">Ideal para Bienestar</span>
            <span class="block font-bold">Mayo — Junio</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg p-3">
            <span class="block text-sm opacity-80">Mejor Calidad-Precio</span>
            <span class="block font-bold">Sept — Oct</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface p-6 rounded-lg border border-border shadow-card flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">payments</span>
          <span class="font-headline-lg">Desglose de Presupuesto</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Lujo Diario</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-text-primary">$250+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full h-2">
            <div class="bg-secondary h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 100%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Gama Media Diaria</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-text-primary">$80 — $150</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full h-2">
            <div class="bg-primary h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 60%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Mochilero Diario</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-text-primary">$30 — $50</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full h-2">
            <div class="bg-outline h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 25%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TOP ACTIVITIES -->
